flowchart TD
  API[API and submission queue] --> DLQ[Shared SQS DLQ]
  SFN[Step Functions Standard execution\n91-day timeout; execution logging without execution data] --> Retry[Task-specific retry policies]
  Retry --> Error[HandleError: application ERROR, logs, SNS ops notification]
  Bedrock[Bedrock adjudication] --> Guardrail[Guardrail block => NEEDS_REVIEW, no fallback]
  Bedrock --> Fallback[Malformed/provider failures => primary retry and validated fallback]
  Delivery[Dispute delivery SQS] --> DeliveryWorker[Delivery Lambda] --> DeliveryDLQ[Delivery DLQ + recovery handler]
  Metrics[Custom metrics + AWS service metrics] --> Alarms[CloudWatch alarms: API, workflow, Bedrock, DDB, liveness, DLQs, delivery]
  Alarms --> SNS[SNS] --> Slack[Slack notifier]
  Trace[X-Ray: API Gateway and VerifiedLambda] -. correlation .-> Metrics
  Sandbox[Sandbox] --> Mocks[Conditional ACIC and VEVO mock stacks]
